WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.725
Welcome to Harbour and Co.

2
00:00:02.775 --> 00:00:05.049
Here's what your first week looks like.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.949
On Monday, you'll meet your team and your buddy.

4
00:00:09.999 --> 00:00:11.773
Midweek is tools training.

5
00:00:11.823 --> 00:00:17.209
On Thursday, you'll shadow a customer call, and Friday ends with a check-in with your manager.

6
00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:21.163
Everything we do comes back to three values.

7
00:00:21.213 --> 00:00:22.476
Customers first.

8
00:00:22.526 --> 00:00:23.766
Own the outcome.

9
00:00:23.816 --> 00:00:24.941
Keep it simple.

10
00:00:26.709 --> 00:00:27.926
Stuck on anything?

11
00:00:27.976 --> 00:00:32.594
Your buddy is your first stop, and the people team is always one message away.

12
00:00:32.644 --> 00:00:33.954
Welcome aboard.

